// A class of the global namespace named `extra` makes a finding's message
// end in `|extra`. The kind of a finding is a field of what makes two
// findings one, and no text a message can spell: both operands are
// reported, with the extra checks on and off.
final class extra
{
}

function power(string $s, string|extra $o): void
{
    echo $s ** $o; // want P2301 "operator ** on string", P2301 "operator ** on string|extra"
}

// The string is an extra check only where nothing else is wrong with the
// expression, which PHPStan reports once for both operands.
function beside(string $s, mixed $m): void
{
    echo $s ** $m; // want P2301 "operator ** on string"
}
